{"unit_id":"songer522__dsh-launcher#card-zh","repo":"songer522/dsh-launcher","commit":"bbc132d56c7719917f6b64752b53e6f05ca0ad31","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Launcher 是一款 macOS 菜单栏应用及其配套的 DSH Host 插件，用于管理本地运行的 DSH Web 服务。应用提供启动、打开浏览器、重启和停止服务等操作，并显示服务器状态与进程信息；插件在服务启动后获取监听端口、进程号和带认证令牌的访问 URL，以 JSON 描述文件供启动器读取，并在服务结束时删除。插件通过 Cordis 注入 webServer 和 connection 服务工作，可配置描述文件路径或禁用写入。适合希望从菜单栏管理本机 DSH Web 服务、或让启动器发现从终端启动的服务的 macOS 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["Sources/DSHLauncher.swift:338","Sources/DSHLauncher.swift:1128-1194","index.js:158-203"]}
{"unit_id":"songer522__dsh-launcher#card-en","repo":"songer522/dsh-launcher","commit":"bbc132d56c7719917f6b64752b53e6f05ca0ad31","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Launcher pairs a macOS menu bar app with a DSH Host plugin. The app starts, opens, restarts, and stops local servers. The plugin writes the running server’s port, process ID, and authenticated URL to a JSON file, then removes it when the service ends. No API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["Sources/DSHLauncher.swift:338","Sources/DSHLauncher.swift:1128-1194","index.js:158-203"]}
